 the artwork a dynamic yet peaceful feel, capturing a moment of stillness and readiness."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 84, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 50, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#1f1f48", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 85, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy cleanGpuUsed", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [295.31390380859375, 26], "pos": [-2103.73193359375, 1366.8763427734375], "id": 51, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "e07b8cc7bfb0dca03da5ac363ad73f717ffa7738", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy cleanGpuUsed"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [308.04949951171875, 331.0021057128906], "pos": [-1476.359375, 1278.203369140625], "widgets_values": ["这是游戏风格的数字艺术品，利用虚幻引擎5（UE5），受中国漫画艺术的影响。中心人物是一个年轻的亚洲女性，具有宁静，集中的表达。她的黑发很长，在风中优雅地流动，她的眼睛略微垂涎，增加了她平静的举止。她穿着一件传统的蓝绿色和服式长袍，在领口上可见一层白色的内层。长袍用黑暗，质地的腰带绑在腰上，使她的衣服增加了深度和对比。\n\n在右手中，她用金属光泽握着一把苗条，锋利的剑，表明它准备使用。背景是柔软，灰色的云层和抽象笔触的混合物，它们会产生一种运动和深度感，暗示着空灵或神秘的环境。整体调色板柔和而凉爽，灰色，蓝绿色和黑色的阴影主导着场景。长袍的质地平滑，褶皱柔和，而窗扇则增加了粗糙的质地。这些元素的结合使艺术品具有充满活力而又和平的感觉，捕捉了寂静和准备的时刻。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 88, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 54, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 10}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links":